	(text "System-5 CPU card Rev D, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  CPU            THE CDP1802 AND THE 36-PIN BUS\n  sheet 3  Clock          4 MHz OSCILLATOR / 2, OR AN EXTERNAL CLOCK; THE DEBUG HEADER\n  sheet 4  Control        RESET, RUN, PAUSE, LOAD: DS1813, RESET/RUN SWITCH, CLEAR/WAIT/DMA-IN BUFFERS, LOADED\n  sheet 5  Boot           A8-A15 LATCH, 2732 BOOT EPROM AT F000, BOOT MAP AND -VMA\n  sheet 6  Flags          EF ROUTING, INTERRUPT, Q LED\n  sheet 7  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, POWER LED\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "563e6368-6cef-51bb-acb0-b799bbbfdf58"))
